# No duplicate truth

Do **not** copy full definitions into secondary docs. Link canonical sources (`docs/CANONICAL_OWNERSHIP.md`).

## Do not duplicate

- Queue semantics → `docs/governance/QUEUE_AND_CAPACITY_POLICY.md`
- Pipeline / entity states → `docs/governance/STATE_MACHINES.md`
- Publish draft vs public → `docs/governance/PUBLISH_POLICY.md`
- Trust levels → `docs/governance/TRUST_POLICY.md`
- Phase execution order → `docs/ROADMAP.md`
- Shipped stage list → `docs/MASTER_PLAN.md`

## Allowed in secondary docs

- One-line summary + markdown link
- Context-specific «see also»

## When editing

If content exists in canonical file → add link, do not paste duplicate section.
